 mode of action in rats</article-title><source>J Reprod Fertil</source><year>1967</year><volume>13</volume><fpage>101</fpage><lpage>119</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">6066766</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B12"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Cole</surname><given-names>MP</given-names></name><name><surname>Jones</surname><given-names>CT</given-names></name><name><surname>Todd</surname><given-names>ID</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>A new anti-oestrogenic agent in late breast cancer. An early clinical appraisal of ICI 46474</article-title><source>Br J Cancer</source><year>1971</year><volume>25</volume><fpage>270</fpage><lpage>275</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">5115829</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B13"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Jordan</surname><given-names>VC</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Tamoxifen: Catalyst for the change to targeted therapy</article-title><source>Eur J Cancer</source><year>2008</year><volume>44</volume><fpage>30</fpage><lpage>38</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18068350</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.ejca.2007.11.002</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B14"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><collab>Early Breast Cancer Trialists' Collaborative Group</collab></person-group><article-title>Effects of chemotherapy and hormonal therapy for early breast cancer on recurrence and 15-year survival: an overview of the randomised trials</article-title><source>Lancet</source><year>2005</year><volume>365</volume><fpage>1687</fpage><lpage>1717</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15894097</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/S0140-6736(05)66544-0</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B15"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Fisher</surname><given-names>B</given-names></name><name><surname>C